WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Inside the Lunar Base, green-lit escape pods line a circular chamber.

2
00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
The station explodes. Debris and fire scatter against the planet's horizon.

3
00:08.500 --> 00:12.000
The Lunar Cry swarm engulfs the station's remains, red creatures swarming.

4
00:12.500 --> 00:15.000
An escape pod launches through fire into the crimson tide.
